# item-5 (verification-reproducibility fix, 2026-08-26): hunter_kinodynamic_rl's
# train_node.py/evaluation_node.py write runtime/experiments/<run>/ RELATIVE
# to whatever CWD they were launched from -- when that's the repo root
# (e.g. `cd ~/DRL_Robot_Path_Planning && ros2 run ...`) the output lands at
# /runtime/ here, a DIFFERENT path than either line above (neither
# `ros2_ws/src/hunter_kinodynamic_rl/runtime/` nor `ros2_ws/runtime/`
# matches a repo-root-relative `runtime/`). Confirmed as a real gap: this
# exact directory (multiple smoke_test run_dirs, checkpoints/logs/
# tensorboard, tens of MB) was sitting untracked-and-NOT-ignored before
# this line.
/runtime/
/runs/

